WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
SPEAKER 1: I am ready
to take my DevOps

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.322
career to the next level.

00:00:03.322 --> 00:00:05.655
SPEAKER 2: Have you considered
Google Cloud Professional

00:00:05.655 --> 00:00:07.555
DevOps Engineer certification?

00:00:07.555 --> 00:00:09.930
SPEAKER 1: Tell me more about
the DevOps engineering role

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.040
itself.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.350
SPEAKER 2: A professional
Cloud DevOps engineer

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.005
is basically responsible
for efficient deployment

00:00:16.005 --> 00:00:20.820
operations, balancing service
reliability and delivery speed.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.340
They are skilled at
using the Google Cloud

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.758
tools to build CICD pipelines
and monitor and manage them.

00:00:27.758 --> 00:00:29.175
SPEAKER 1: Are
there prerequisites

00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:30.180
to approach the exam?

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.680
SPEAKER 2: It's
recommended that you

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.480
have about three years
of industry experience,

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.230
including maybe one year of
managing solutions on Google

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.040
Cloud.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.710
SPEAKER 1: Any advice on
where I should I get started?

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.710
SPEAKER 2: There are tons
of training resources,

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.550
from sample questions
to hands-on labs

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.155
and on-demand courses.

00:00:46.155 --> 00:00:47.370
Check them out.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.170
And did I mention
you will receive

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:53.250
a digital badge, an online
certificate, and swag?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.600
[MUSIC PLAYING]

